make her hers every day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her tiny breasts, her lewdness as a succubus could be described as inversely related to it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attempted translation of parts of Getchu description."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38947"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界・ラインフォースの魔族“サキュバス”の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元は最下層に住む魔族だったが、とある魔道具を手にいれ、見違えるほどの魔力を有するようになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何かと騒がしく、不平不満をマシンガンのように口にするタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"惚れたマリアを、何とか自分のモノにするため、四人の天使を“魔鎧”でサキュバス化させ、煉にけしかける。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18899","sourceWorkId":"10320","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"異世界ラインフォースの最下層の魔族であるサキュバスの少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、とある魔道具を手にしてからは、その力が飛躍的に膨れ上がり、幼い風貌からは想像もつかないほどの魔力をその身に秘めるようになってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"麗しき天使であるマリアに惚れており、何とか自分のものにしたいと日々画策する。何かと騒がしく、不平不満であればマシンガンのように口から出るわがまま娘。……に反して、本などの文献を読むのが好きという一面もあり、部下となった4人の少女に、サキュバスの鎧『魔鎧（まがい）』を与え、地球の文献からヒントを得た名前をつけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"貧乳だが、サキュバスとしての淫乱さはそれに反比例する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204404"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"135 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18899","sourceWorkId":"10320","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b96defe6cd079d37971e2c9931516cf62a1a11e10f59e3ad0827258edda6c45.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b2fe4be98d177bd96330bbfb454da0ed6c0fe8e46742be8f932f8df6e5154634.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中田順子","creatorId":"vndb:s631","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s631","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s631","name":"中田 順子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:301720:204404:4463:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c38950","characterName":"リフェル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204405","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301720"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18900"],"vndbCharacterId":"c38950"},"originalCharacterName":"リフェル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maria’s commanding officer. She’s something like Maria’s right-hand man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her angel powers are not as strong as Maria’s. Even so, she compensates for it with great effort, which is how she reached her current position. Maria has the utmost trust in her, and so they fight quite well together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, her personality is a bit too broad-minded as she has experience with many men. While her views differ from Maria in this respect, she still sincerely wishes for a good person to show up for Maria some day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"But… she falls for Alp’s trap. She becomes a succubus, her heart becomes perverted, and she indiscriminately rapes men and women."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her character is now one of arrogance. She eagerly aims to defeat Maria."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Enormous breasts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attempted translation of parts of Getchu description."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38950"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"マリアを敬愛していた元戦天使。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隊の中では一番男性経験が豊富で、色恋沙汰にも興味津々。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“魔鎧”でサキュバス化してからは、他人を貶めることに快感を見出す「傲慢な性格」に変わり、尊敬していたマリアでさえも、堕落させようとする。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18900","sourceWorkId":"10320","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"マリアを隊長とする騎士隊の騎士で、マリアの右腕的存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"天使の一人だがマリアほどに天使の力は○くない。それでも努力でそれを補い、今の地位に就く。マリアの信頼を一身に受け、共に戦う少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしながら性格は天使であるにしては大らか過ぎ、多くの男性との関係を経験してきた。この点に関してのみ、マリアと意見が合わないものの、いつしかマリアにもいい人が現れることを心から願っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、アルプの罠に落ち、サキュバスとなってしまった彼女は、魔鎧・ベリアルに心を束縛され、無差別に人々を組み伏せて、淫らにその腰を振る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その性格は傲慢。マリアを討つべく虎視眈々と狙う。爆乳。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"204405"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18900","sourceWorkId":"10320","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/99/9915d8509b94c466b6fcc10c5f470673153b6f3160887433db91da1b22413dce.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/24e26374ead94d80e4f71b895c324ffb5257e7c8d4ade79a18f24099ef4cf45b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:301720:204405:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c38952","characterName":"ティリア","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"204406","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"301720"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18901"],"vndbCharacterId":"c38952"},"originalCharacterName":"ティリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maria’s commanding officer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attempted translation of a part of Getchu description."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c38952"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"臆病ながらも隊の楯となり、守る役目をになっていた戦天使。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのおどおど怖がりした性格は、“魔鎧”の効果で一転、欲しいモノをとにかく求めてしまう、淫乱で貪欲な性格に。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彼女が欲する対象は、男だけに収まらず、マリアにも魔の手を伸ばしていく。"}],"source":"egs","s